        "exegesisEn": "Canonical Text: \"鸣谦，利用行师，征邑国。\"; Xiang Commentary: \"鸣谦，志未得也。可用行师，征邑国也。\". Within the paradigm of Hexagram 15 [Modesty / Humility], Line 6 governs a decisive developmental inflection point. [Top Line · Culmination & Renewal]: The ultimate zenith where fullness turns to cyclic return. Graceful retreat and philosophical detachment avert extreme peril. The interaction between this line's polarity and position signals that immediate reality is transitioning into a new phase; align inner intent with natural timing.",
        "practicalZh": "💼 事业与重大决策：当前阶段切忌凭直觉冒进或意气用事。若遇阻力当退求其次打磨硬核竞争力；若迎良机当果断联合可靠伙伴推进，以合规制度防范法律与财务暗礁。\n🤝 人际与合伙情缘：彼此沟通需秉持真诚透明，尊重对方核心诉求与边界；避免因权力争夺或情绪宣泄导致盟友反目。\n🛡️ 趋避锦囊：宜【恪守底线、按部就班、广积粮缓称王】；忌【好大喜功、越权任性、背信弃义】。",
        "practicalEn": "💼 Career & Decisions: Guard against hasty overextension; consolidate core craftsmanship if challenged, and forge reliable alliances when breakthrough opportunities appear.\n🤝 Relationships: Lead with transparent reciprocity and respectful boundaries; resolve tension through principled communication.\n🛡️ Tactical Action: [Favorable]: Grounded discipline, steady compounding, patient positioning. [Taboo]: Vanity, breaching protocols, impulsive gambles.",
        "guidanceZh": "审时度势，中正自持；遵奉【鸣谦，利用行师，征邑国。】之训诫，知进退存亡之机。",
