        "exegesisEn": "Canonical Text: \"剥之，无咎。\"; Xiang Commentary: \"剥之无咎，失上下也。\". Within the paradigm of Hexagram 23 [Splitting Apart / Stripping Away], Line 3 governs a decisive developmental inflection point. [Third Line · Transitional Criticality]: The volatile threshold between inner and outer realms. Demands heightened vigilance and ethical rectitude to transcend deadlock. The interaction between this line's polarity and position signals that immediate reality is transitioning into a new phase; align inner intent with natural timing.",
        "practicalZh": "💼 事业与重大决策：当前阶段切忌凭直觉冒进或意气用事。若遇阻力当退求其次打磨硬核竞争力；若迎良机当果断联合可靠伙伴推进，以合规制度防范法律与财务暗礁。\n🤝 人际与合伙情缘：彼此沟通需秉持真诚透明，尊重对方核心诉求与边界；避免因权力争夺或情绪宣泄导致盟友反目。\n🛡️ 趋避锦囊：宜【恪守底线、按部就班、广积粮缓称王】；忌【好大喜功、越权任性、背信弃义】。",
        "practicalEn": "💼 Career & Decisions: Guard against hasty overextension; consolidate core craftsmanship if challenged, and forge reliable alliances when breakthrough opportunities appear.\n🤝 Relationships: Lead with transparent reciprocity and respectful boundaries; resolve tension through principled communication.\n🛡️ Tactical Action: [Favorable]: Grounded discipline, steady compounding, patient positioning. [Taboo]: Vanity, breaching protocols, impulsive gambles.",
        "guidanceZh": "审时度势，中正自持；遵奉【剥之，无咎。】之训诫，知进退存亡之机。",
        "guidanceEn": "Align conduct with \"剥之，无咎。\"; master situational timing and grounded rectitude."
