      "philosophyEn": "Hexagram 27 [Nourishment / Swallowing], formed by upper Mountain (Gen) and lower Thunder (Zhen). Governs cyclic rhythm, systemic balance, and timely discernment.",
      "careerZh": "事业推进宜审察时度，根据【山雷颐】之义调控节奏。合乎天理、顺应趋势，方能克难攻坚。",
      "careerEn": "Calibrate strategic momentum in accordance with Nourishment / Swallowing; prioritize ethical alignment and disciplined execution.",
