      "wealthEn": "Financial prudence and capital preservation; avoid speculative bubbles and maintain healthy liquidity.",
      "relationshipZh": "人际交往与情感相处贵在真诚坦荡、以心换心；尊重差异，以包容达成长久和合。",
      "relationshipEn": "Interpersonal harmony thrives on sincere transparency and mutual boundary respect.",
      "actionGuidanceZh": "【宜】：顺天应时、修身正己、恪守底线、稳中求进。【忌】：盲动冒进、心存侥幸、任性专断、言行不一。",
      "actionGuidanceEn": "[Favorable]: Aligning with natural timing, ethical integrity, grounded patience. [Taboo]: Reckless haste, arrogant obstinacy, broken promises."
