        "exegesisZh": "【爻辞微言大义】：经文言“嘉遁，贞吉。”，《小象传》剖析“嘉遁贞吉，以正志也。”。在【天山遁】这一时空格局中，第5爻的变动深刻揭示了事态演进的微妙枢纽。【五爻·九五至尊主事位】：全卦之统帅中枢与天地定海神针。执掌最高决策大权，兼具宏大格局与中正之德。行事当公允仁厚、顺天应人，以大格局统摄群伦。 此爻阴阳爻象与本位交互，表征当事人正面临从量变向质变跃迁的关键时刻。古圣先贤借物取象，告诫当事人必须深刻参透事理规律，顺天应时，在看似平静的表面下洞察深层暗涌。",
        "exegesisEn": "Canonical Text: \"嘉遁，贞吉。\"; Xiang Commentary: \"嘉遁贞吉，以正志也。\". Within the paradigm of Hexagram 33 [Retreat / Strategic Withdrawal], Line 5 governs a decisive developmental inflection point. [Fifth Line · Sovereign Command Zenith]: The supreme fulcrum of the hexagram. Commands executive authority through upright justice, magnanimity, and systemic balance. The interaction between this line's polarity and position signals that immediate reality is transitioning into a new phase; align inner intent with natural timing.",
        "practicalZh": "💼 事业与重大决策：当前阶段切忌凭直觉冒进或意气用事。若遇阻力当退求其次打磨硬核竞争力；若迎良机当果断联合可靠伙伴推进，以合规制度防范法律与财务暗礁。\n🤝 人际与合伙情缘：彼此沟通需秉持真诚透明，尊重对方核心诉求与边界；避免因权力争夺或情绪宣泄导致盟友反目。\n🛡️ 趋避锦囊：宜【恪守底线、按部就班、广积粮缓称王】；忌【好大喜功、越权任性、背信弃义】。",
        "practicalEn": "💼 Career & Decisions: Guard against hasty overextension; consolidate core craftsmanship if challenged, and forge reliable alliances when breakthrough opportunities appear.\n🤝 Relationships: Lead with transparent reciprocity and respectful boundaries; resolve tension through principled communication.\n🛡️ Tactical Action: [Favorable]: Grounded discipline, steady compounding, patient positioning. [Taboo]: Vanity, breaching protocols, impulsive gambles.",
        "guidanceZh": "审时度势，中正自持；遵奉【嘉遁，贞吉。】之训诫，知进退存亡之机。",
        "guidanceEn": "Align conduct with \"嘉遁，贞吉。\"; master situational timing and grounded rectitude."
