      "careerEn": "Calibrate strategic momentum in accordance with The Family / Domestic Order; prioritize ethical alignment and disciplined execution.",
      "wealthZh": "财务管理重在防范风险、理性布局。适时收放资金，不盲目追求短期暴利。",
