        "exegesisZh": "【爻辞微言大义】：经文言“来兑，凶。”，《小象传》剖析“来兑之凶，位不当也。”。在【兑为泽】这一时空格局中，第3爻的变动深刻揭示了事态演进的微妙枢纽。【三爻·重刚多惧临界位】：下卦登顶向外卦跨越之险隘，内外交接、进退多疑。极易因躁进遭遇反噬或因保守错失良机。唯有终日自省警惕、恪守正道，方能渡过险滩。 此爻阴阳爻象与本位交互，表征当事人正面临从量变向质变跃迁的关键时刻。古圣先贤借物取象，告诫当事人必须深刻参透事理规律，顺天应时，在看似平静的表面下洞察深层暗涌。",
        "exegesisEn": "Canonical Text: \"来兑，凶。\"; Xiang Commentary: \"来兑之凶，位不当也。\". Within the paradigm of Hexagram 58 [The Joyous Lake / Open Exchange], Line 3 governs a decisive developmental inflection point. [Third Line · Transitional Criticality]: The volatile threshold between inner and outer realms. Demands heightened vigilance and ethical rectitude to transcend deadlock. The interaction between this line's polarity and position signals that immediate reality is transitioning into a new phase; align inner intent with natural timing.",
        "practicalZh": "💼 事业与重大决策：当前阶段切忌凭直觉冒进或意气用事。若遇阻力当退求其次打磨硬核竞争力；若迎良机当果断联合可靠伙伴推进，以合规制度防范法律与财务暗礁。\n🤝 人际与合伙情缘：彼此沟通需秉持真诚透明，尊重对方核心诉求与边界；避免因权力争夺或情绪宣泄导致盟友反目。\n🛡️ 趋避锦囊：宜【恪守底线、按部就班、广积粮缓称王】；忌【好大喜功、越权任性、背信弃义】。",
        "practicalEn": "💼 Career & Decisions: Guard against hasty overextension; consolidate core craftsmanship if challenged, and forge reliable alliances when breakthrough opportunities appear.\n🤝 Relationships: Lead with transparent reciprocity and respectful boundaries; resolve tension through principled communication.\n🛡️ Tactical Action: [Favorable]: Grounded discipline, steady compounding, patient positioning. [Taboo]: Vanity, breaching protocols, impulsive gambles.",
        "guidanceZh": "审时度势，中正自持；遵奉【来兑，凶。】之训诫，知进退存亡之机。",
        "guidanceEn": "Align conduct with \"来兑，凶。\"; master situational timing and grounded rectitude."
